{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard the Driftwood Diner! Embark on a culinary adventure as you run your very own restaurant on a boat. After losing your home in a forest fire, you're determined to earn money and help rebuild  your community. <br> <br><strong>Master The Cook</strong><br> <br>Cook up some comfort food from your boat-side kitchen. Master the timing and tools of your kitchen to keep orders flowing and customers happy!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/e137e6f95aafe3b9f9983e7ea187a635.poster.avif?t=1752946352\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/e137e6f95aafe3b9f9983e7ea187a635.webm?t=1752946352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/e137e6f95aafe3b9f9983e7ea187a635.mp4?t=1752946352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast Your Line</strong> <br> <br>Cast a line and catch your customers dinner. Use Timing and Skill to hook a fish, and expand your menu with your latest catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/bd450084433dd9a4853aa577b1e4818a.poster.avif?t=1752946352\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/bd450084433dd9a4853aa577b1e4818a.webm?t=1752946352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/bd450084433dd9a4853aa577b1e4818a.mp4?t=1752946352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Your Grub</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, water and harvest your own ingredients! Balance your time between cooking and cultivating by growing rare crops for new dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/612a8c1d9853ec449e9bf3283d1e7403.poster.avif?t=1752946352\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/612a8c1d9853ec449e9bf3283d1e7403.webm?t=1752946352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/612a8c1d9853ec449e9bf3283d1e7403.mp4?t=1752946352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Serve delicious meals, explore new waters, and bring joy to your customers as you sail from port to port. Every dish you create brings you one step closer to rebuilding your community. The Driftwood Diner is open \u2014 and your story is just beginning! <br><br><i><strong>Developer Note</strong></i><strong> </strong><br><br>Hey! Thanks so much for checking out the game! I am a solo developer working on making this game the best it can possible be. I received a lot of support and great comments from the community to help shape it into a game hopefully everyone would love. If you are interested in joining the community consider joining the discord and letting me know what you think of the game so far!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609330?t=1752946352","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609330?t=1752946352","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/c17bd7c9a2b5b92adde328a38458f013ebef22c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752946352","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/c17bd7c9a2b5b92adde328a38458f013ebef22c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752946352","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome aboard the Driftwood Diner! Embark on a culinary adventure as you run your very own restaurant on a boat. After losing your home in a forest fire, you're determined to earn money and help rebuild  your community. <br> <br><strong>Master The Cook</strong><br> <br>Cook up some comfort food from your boat-side kitchen. Master the timing and tools of your kitchen to keep orders flowing and customers happy!  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/e137e6f95aafe3b9f9983e7ea187a635.poster.avif?t=1752946352\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/e137e6f95aafe3b9f9983e7ea187a635.webm?t=1752946352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/e137e6f95aafe3b9f9983e7ea187a635.mp4?t=1752946352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast Your Line</strong> <br> <br>Cast a line and catch your customers dinner. Use Timing and Skill to hook a fish, and expand your menu with your latest catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/bd450084433dd9a4853aa577b1e4818a.poster.avif?t=1752946352\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/bd450084433dd9a4853aa577b1e4818a.webm?t=1752946352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/bd450084433dd9a4853aa577b1e4818a.mp4?t=1752946352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Your Grub</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant, water and harvest your own ingredients! Balance your time between cooking and cultivating by growing rare crops for new dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/612a8c1d9853ec449e9bf3283d1e7403.poster.avif?t=1752946352\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/612a8c1d9853ec449e9bf3283d1e7403.webm?t=1752946352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/extras/612a8c1d9853ec449e9bf3283d1e7403.mp4?t=1752946352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Serve delicious meals, explore new waters, and bring joy to your customers as you sail from port to port. Every dish you create brings you one step closer to rebuilding your community. The Driftwood Diner is open \u2014 and your story is just beginning! <br><br><i><strong>Developer Note</strong></i><strong> </strong><br><br>Hey! Thanks so much for checking out the game! I am a solo developer working on making this game the best it can possible be. I received a lot of support and great comments from the community to help shape it into a game hopefully everyone would love. If you are interested in joining the community consider joining the discord and letting me know what you think of the game so far!</p>","developers":["Dev Seth Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609330/608404606614f648b1c1aac932baed590b941b02/header.jpg?t=1752946352","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3609330/854546/bfdc5f3d249f94f895ffbf4cf81ca22d0fd9a24c/1750450987/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743047196","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3609330/854546/bfdc5f3d249f94f895ffbf4cf81ca22d0fd9a24c/1750450987/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743047196","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3609330/854546/bfdc5f3d249f94f895ffbf4cf81ca22d0fd9a24c/1750450987/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743047196","id":257116575,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116575/movie480.mp4?t=1743047196","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116575/movie_max.mp4?t=1743047196"},"name":"Driftwood Diner - Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116575/914cea5728613602aa877f2e6f1c8eb11016268e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743047196","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116575/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743047196","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116575/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743047196"}}],"name":"Driftwood Diner","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Direct X 9.0c compliant video card with 512 MB of RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Dev Seth Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"